WEBVTT

00:00:08.228 --> 00:00:11.314
(baby cooing)

00:00:12.857 --> 00:00:15.402
(babbling quietly)

00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:22.951
She's perfect.

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:25.453
I think we should call her...

00:00:25.537 --> 00:00:27.664
Ellie.

00:00:27.747 --> 00:00:29.249
Little Ellie.

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:31.084
I got a better name:

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.544
Peaches.

00:00:32.627 --> 00:00:33.878
Peaches?

00:00:33.962 --> 00:00:35.046
Why not?

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:39.551
She's sweet and round
and covered with fuzz.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.886
Peaches.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.763
I love it.

00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:46.683
(sniffles)

00:00:46.766 --> 00:00:48.101
I saw that, tough guy.

00:00:48.184 --> 00:00:52.105
No, no. That last dino
caught my eye with a claw and...

00:00:52.188 --> 00:00:53.857
All right, so I'm not made of stone.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.317
SID:
Incoming!

00:00:57.444 --> 00:00:58.737
MANNY:
It's Sid!

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.904
(whimpers)

00:00:59.988 --> 00:01:01.072
Ow! Aah!

00:01:01.156 --> 00:01:03.450
(Peaches crying)

00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:04.993
Oh, it's a boy!

00:01:05.076 --> 00:01:06.161
That's its tail.

00:01:06.244 --> 00:01:08.246
It's a girl!

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:10.081
Oh, hi, sweetheart!

00:01:10.165 --> 00:01:11.291
Hello, hello.

00:01:11.374 --> 00:01:12.917
It's Uncle Sid.
Yes, it is.

00:01:13.001 --> 00:01:14.753
Oh, you're so beautiful.

00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:15.962
Oh, she is!

00:01:16.045 --> 00:01:18.006
She looks just like her mother.

00:01:18.089 --> 00:01:19.799
(chuckles):
Thank goodness.

00:01:19.883 --> 00:01:21.468
Oh, no offense, Manny, no offense.

00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:23.803
You're beautiful on the inside.

00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:25.513
It's good to have you back, Sid.

00:01:25.597 --> 00:01:27.640
Never thought I would
say this, but...

00:01:27.724 --> 00:01:29.309
I missed you, buddy.

00:01:29.392 --> 00:01:31.728
(Peaches giggling)

00:01:33.646 --> 00:01:36.191
Oh, I wish my kids were here.

00:01:36.274 --> 00:01:38.151
You could have been friends.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.778
(babbling)

00:01:39.861 --> 00:01:41.780
Ellie!

00:01:43.239 --> 00:01:44.574
Goo, goo, goo.

00:01:44.657 --> 00:01:46.951
I promised myself I wouldn't cry.

00:01:47.035 --> 00:01:48.119
I didn't.

00:01:48.203 --> 00:01:50.371
(bawling loudly)

00:01:50.455 --> 00:01:52.499
(blows nose)

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:56.961
I forgot what it was like
to be part of a family.

00:01:57.045 --> 00:01:59.839
What about you?
Ever thought about having kids?

00:01:59.923 --> 00:02:01.966
(gulps, screeches)

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.636
Hm. All right, mammals...

00:02:04.719 --> 00:02:07.472
let's get you home.

00:02:15.563 --> 00:02:18.566
(playful shouts, panting)

00:02:22.612 --> 00:02:26.950
(scratchy record playing
mid-tempo pop intro)

00:02:28.326 --> 00:02:30.578
♪ Alone again ♪

00:02:30.662 --> 00:02:33.373
♪ Naturally ♪

00:02:33.456 --> 00:02:34.666
(screams)

00:02:34.749 --> 00:02:36.501
♪ I shouldn't be hanging 'round ♪

00:02:36.584 --> 00:02:39.712
♪ But my world's turned upside down ♪

00:02:39.796 --> 00:02:42.549
♪ You abandoned me,
I fell off the tree ♪

00:02:42.632 --> 00:02:44.676
♪ To the hard and lonely ground ♪

00:02:44.759 --> 00:02:47.345
-(sighing)
-♪ You found somebody new ♪

00:02:47.428 --> 00:02:50.515
-(thunder crashes)
-♪ Cracked my shell in two ♪

00:02:50.598 --> 00:02:53.518
♪ How could I foresee
you'd turn out to be ♪

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:56.646
-(chuckles)
-♪ Such a buck-toothed Casanova? ♪

00:02:56.729 --> 00:02:58.815
♪ Now there's only strife ♪

00:02:58.898 --> 00:03:02.193
♪ And my life has lost
all meaning ♪

00:03:02.277 --> 00:03:04.821
♪ How I miss your furry lips ♪

00:03:04.904 --> 00:03:07.699
♪ Your shallow, rapid breathing ♪

00:03:07.782 --> 00:03:10.285
♪ I wish you only knew ♪

00:03:10.368 --> 00:03:13.204
♪ That I'm only nuts for you ♪

00:03:13.288 --> 00:03:15.665
♪ Alone again ♪

00:03:15.748 --> 00:03:17.584
♪ Naturally ♪

00:03:18.751 --> 00:03:20.628
♪ Alone again ♪

00:03:21.546 --> 00:03:24.507
♪ Naturally ♪

00:03:27.218 --> 00:03:29.470
-(loud crack)
-(song ends)

00:03:33.224 --> 00:03:34.976
BUCK:
This is it, mammals.

00:03:35.059 --> 00:03:36.895
Right where you started.

00:03:36.978 --> 00:03:38.396
This was fun.

00:03:38.479 --> 00:03:40.273
We could make it a regular thing.

00:03:40.356 --> 00:03:41.316
(laughs)

00:03:41.399 --> 00:03:42.942
I don't know about that.

00:03:43.026 --> 00:03:44.736
BUCK:
Right. Right, yes.

00:03:44.819 --> 00:03:46.863
'Cause of all the, uh, mortal peril.

00:03:46.946 --> 00:03:48.489
Of course.

00:03:48.573 --> 00:03:51.659
Oh, well. The Buck stops here.

00:03:51.743 --> 00:03:53.703
We couldn't have
done it without you.

00:03:53.786 --> 00:03:55.038
Well, obviously.

00:03:55.121 --> 00:03:58.333
But good times just the sa...
(loud, deep breathing)

00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:00.752
We're not alone, are we?

00:04:02.337 --> 00:04:03.296
(all gasp)

00:04:04.881 --> 00:04:06.841
Hello, Rudy.

00:04:13.056 --> 00:04:15.141
(roars)

00:04:15.224 --> 00:04:17.060
BUCK:
Run!

00:04:17.143 --> 00:04:18.227
(all screaming)

00:04:20.396 --> 00:04:21.272
(gasping)

00:04:21.356 --> 00:04:23.566
(growling)

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.486
BUCK:
Over here, you colossal fossil!

00:04:26.569 --> 00:04:28.196
Looking for something?

00:04:30.323 --> 00:04:32.116
Why don't you come and get it?

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.077
To the cave! Go!

00:04:37.121 --> 00:04:38.247
Stay with the baby.

00:04:38.331 --> 00:04:39.707
We'll be fine. Go.

00:04:42.543 --> 00:04:43.753
(screaming)

00:04:45.922 --> 00:04:47.465
(frightened chattering)

00:04:47.548 --> 00:04:49.926
Wuss.

00:04:50.009 --> 00:04:53.012
(grunting, roaring)

00:04:53.096 --> 00:04:55.139
(panting, groaning)

00:04:59.185 --> 00:05:01.396
(low growl)

00:05:01.479 --> 00:05:03.398
Pop goes the weasel!

00:05:04.482 --> 00:05:06.150
(roars)

00:05:06.234 --> 00:05:08.820
(screaming)

00:05:08.903 --> 00:05:11.489
(grunting)

00:05:11.572 --> 00:05:12.782
(roars)

00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:15.535
Shoo! Shoo!

00:05:15.618 --> 00:05:17.161
Come on! Move!

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.706
(roaring)

00:05:19.789 --> 00:05:21.165
Diego!

00:05:21.249 --> 00:05:22.834
Gotcha!

00:05:22.917 --> 00:05:24.877
(panting)

00:05:24.961 --> 00:05:26.254
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:26.337 --> 00:05:28.631
(snarls)

00:05:28.715 --> 00:05:30.383
(grunting)

00:05:30.466 --> 00:05:32.885
Ha!

00:05:32.969 --> 00:05:34.512
Through the hole,
over the valley.

00:05:34.595 --> 00:05:36.097
One more loop.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.098
Come on, lads!

00:05:37.181 --> 00:05:38.808
Heave!

00:05:38.891 --> 00:05:41.144
(grunting)

00:05:43.896 --> 00:05:45.273
(growling)

00:05:48.985 --> 00:05:51.112
(groans weakly)

00:05:52.947 --> 00:05:54.866
Better luck next time, snowflake.

00:05:54.949 --> 00:05:56.242
This isn't going to hold him long!

00:05:56.325 --> 00:05:57.285
Let's go!

00:05:57.368 --> 00:05:58.703
Hold up, guys!

00:05:58.786 --> 00:06:01.164
(grunts, sighs)

00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:06.669
(screams, panting)

00:06:07.837 --> 00:06:09.839
(snapping)

00:06:11.466 --> 00:06:13.342
(roars)

00:06:13.426 --> 00:06:14.761
(screaming)

00:06:14.844 --> 00:06:16.304
(roars)

00:06:16.387 --> 00:06:17.513
(screaming)

00:06:21.476 --> 00:06:23.519
Way to go, Momzilla!

00:06:26.939 --> 00:06:28.232
(roaring)

00:06:28.316 --> 00:06:29.484
(gasping)

00:06:29.567 --> 00:06:31.694
(wailing)

00:06:36.824 --> 00:06:39.994
(roaring)

00:06:40.078 --> 00:06:41.913
(high-pitched roaring)

00:06:41.996 --> 00:06:44.499
(silly roaring)

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.213
(purring and cooing)

00:06:55.635 --> 00:06:57.136
Come here, kids.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.513
Well, let me tell you something.

00:06:58.596 --> 00:07:00.473
You're where you belong now.

00:07:00.556 --> 00:07:05.603
And I'm sure you're going to grow up
to be giant, horrifying dinosaurs.

00:07:05.686 --> 00:07:07.230
Just like your mother.

00:07:07.313 --> 00:07:08.439
(growls gently)

00:07:09.774 --> 00:07:11.400
And Mama...

00:07:12.276 --> 00:07:15.029
...take good care of our kids.

00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:19.867
(whimpers)

00:07:21.911 --> 00:07:23.913
(whimpering)

00:07:27.625 --> 00:07:29.293
(moaning)

00:07:31.879 --> 00:07:33.840
(chittering)

